          "description": "Presumably Thebes. Purchased from Paul Mallon. Formerly in the collection of Comte Le Marois, Normandy (\"For the Egyptian Head of Lion, it comes from the own collection of Comte Demaroix [sic],\" letter from Mallon, 1 March 1916, CMA Archives)",
